# HAVEN frontend (Vite). Every key is optional.
# Clerk sign-in for the command centre and the phones (the story page stays public). Without it the app runs open.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Backend elsewhere than the Vite proxy (deploy): the WebSocket URL at build time.
VITE_HAVEN_WS=
# Roles come from the backend (CLERK_SECRET_KEY there): set public_metadata.role on a user in the Clerk dashboard
# to resident | ra | maintenance | admin (no role = resident).
